                                "sense_id": "9d70b7a3-4db8-341f-807f-bd8a88cd7b42",
                                "text": "This Beowulf is based on a new animated movie of the same name... so yes, this counts as yet another game based on a movie, which basically relegates it to teh suck status in the minds of most."
                            },
                            {
